{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q6151362","formula":"C₂₁H₂₉N₅O₂","hill":"C21H29N5O2","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":21.0,"H":29.0,"N":5.0,"O":2.0},"names":{"en":"Tandospirone","uk":"Тандоспірон"},"descriptions":{"en":"Tandospirone, sold under the brand name Sediel, is an anxiolytic and antidepressant medication used in Japan and China, where it is marketed by Dainippon Sumitomo Pharma. It is a member of the azapirone class of drugs and is closely related to other azapirones like buspirone and gepirone. Tandospirone was introduced for medical use in Japan in 1996 and in China in 2004.","uk":"Тандоспірон (англ. Tandospirone), який продається під торговою маркою «Седіель» — анксіолітик та антидепресант, який використовується в Японії та Китаї, де його продає компанія «Sumitomo Pharma». Він є одним із групи похідних азапірону, і тісно пов'язаний з іншими азапіронами, такими як буспірон і гепірон."},"fame":15,"pubchemCid":91273,"mass":383.5,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1C[C@H]2C[C@@H]1[C@H]3[C@@H]2C(=O)N(C3=O)CCCCN4CCN(CC4)C5=NC=CC=N5","inchikey":"CEIJFEGBUDEYSX-FZDBZEDMSA-N","iupac":"(1S,2R,6S,7R)-4-[4-(4-pyrimidin-2-ylpiperazin-1-yl)butyl]-4-azatricyclo[5.2.1.02,6]decane-3,5-dione","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"91273","atoms":57,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-4.292,"y":0.89,"z":-2.332,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.818,"y":-2.208,"z":1.073,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.731,"y":-0.743,"z":-0.749,"el":"N"},{"x":2.334,"y":0.699,"z":-0.338,"el":"N"},{"x":5.113,"y":0.192,"z":0.089,"el":"N"},{"x":6.98,"y":-1.211,"z":-0.26,"el":"N"},{"x":7.253,"y":0.984,"z":0.695,"el":"N"},{"x":-6.416,"y":1.257,"z":-0.074,"el":"C"},{"x":-6.189,"y":-0.236,"z":1.569,"el":"C"},{"x":-5.947,"y":-0.008,"z":-0.818,"el":"C"},{"x":-5.791,"y":-1.036,"z":0.314,"el":"C"},{"x":-5.667,"y":1.17,"z":1.258